        {
          "key": "about_title",
          "value": "Hey, I'm Joe — your friendly Montreal realtor.",
          "updated_at": "2026-05-16T16:03:26.601Z"
        },
        {
          "key": "about_text",
          "value": "I've been helping families in Montreal sell their homes for over 15 years. From the Plateau to Verdun, from Rosemont to NDG, I know the neighborhoods, the buyers, and exactly what your home is worth in today's market.\n\nWhat makes me different? I'm here for the relationship, not just the transaction. I'll never push you to list before you're ready. And when we do sell, I'll fight for every dollar like it's coming out of my own pocket.",
          "updated_at": "2026-05-16T16:03:26.605Z"
        },
